      "content": "idk, it feels like more than just a feeling though. like, the math just doesn't add up. i look at the damage i caused and then i look at myself and there's no way to fix it. i'm just a net negative to everyone around me. it's like i'm fundamentally broken or something. do you think some people are just born wrong?",
